Z||000000||Springtyme||10-30-2001||08:41 AM||||Well, it took me forever to figure out how to make the ftp site, but I got it working. I made a few videos of my car at night after a few modifications. I got a pontiac decal for the top of my windshield, which actually looks pretty good even though we kind of put it on a little off center. I got the xenon headlight conversion kit, so I have bright bluish lights =) And I got these things which crack me up... They're little lights that go on your tire stems. They're light sensitive and motion sensitive so at night when my wheels spin they light up and flash. Since these movies are at night all you can really see are the 2 lights. I'll see about getting a picture of the decal and posting it a little later today. Here is the link to the videos. The biggest one is 199 kb so they're all pretty small in file size. Clip 7 and 8 are of my car racing against a Sundance. Enjoy! <BR> <A HREF="http://129.21.132.60/spring/movies/" TARGET=_blank>http://129.21.132.60/spring/movies/</A> <P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Springtyme.jpg"> ||||reg||1
